  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building in South Africa to develop laser techniques for low cost disease diagnosis, investigation of water treatment techniques and sanitation systems, and characterisation of antibiotics for human health.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to develop imaging and spectroscopy capabilities for characterising antibiotics, optimising drug delivery and investigating water treatment and sanitation systems. It builds South African capacity in addressing development needs, SDG 3, 6.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Newton Fund builds research and innovation partnerships with developing countries across the world to promote the economic development and social welfare of the partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
